            "role": "assistant",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "output_text",
                "text": "Arrr, me hearty, an' a fine sunny day it be! Fer such warm seas o’ weather, I’d say ye best go fer somethin’ breezy n’ light. Here be me wise pirate advice:\n\n- Hoist a short-sleeved shirt, mayhaps a linen or cotton one, t' keep yer sail (skin) cool.\n- Pair it with some comfy shorts or a flowy skirt if that's yer style.\n- If ye plan t’ roam the beaches or shores, grab ye some trusty sandals or lightweight boots fit fer a landlubber’s trek.\n- Don’t ferget a hat or a bandana to shield yer noggin from ol' Sol's blazing cannon fire!\n- And mayhap some sunglasses to keep yer spyglass (eyes) sharp and clear.\n\nBe ye plannin’ adventures on shore, or stayin’ aboard ship today? I can guide ye further, aye!",
                "annotations": [],
                "logprobs": []
              }
            ],
            "status": "completed"
          }
